; A pad from a sub-account of the asserted account moves units within the total it
; asserts, so it cannot make the assertion hold: it fails, as in beancount.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
2020-01-01 commodity CNY
2020-01-01 commodity USD

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking
2024-01-01 open Equity:Open
2024-01-02 * "init"
  Assets:Bank:Checking 100 CNY
  Equity:Open
2024-01-04 pad Assets:Bank Assets:Bank:Checking
2024-01-05 balance Assets:Bank 150 CNY
